# Repository root build context.
#
# No image in this project is built from the repository root. Every service has its
# own context: app/vote, app/result and app/worker, each with its own .dockerignore.
# This file exists as a safety net, so that an accidental "docker build ." never
# sends secrets, Terraform state or a kubeconfig into a build.
#
# Docker reads only the .dockerignore that sits in the context directory. Rules here
# do not apply to app/vote, app/result or app/worker.

# Version control
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# Secrets and environment files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Infrastructure state and access
infra
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
.kube

# Not needed by any application image
docs
deploy
tests
scripts
*.md
LICENSE
Makefile
pyproject.toml

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/bin
**/obj

# Tool caches and reports
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.trivycache
**/*.sarif
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Editors and operating system
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Scratch files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
ns.tmp
